  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our cup is overflowing, help us help more students</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">After 13 years running Tea Leaf education centres in Sri Lankan tea estates communities, we know just how essential education is in empowering young people from these communities to expand their career prospects, realise their potential and help lift their families out of extreme poverty. Our Tea Leaf Centres which provide free professional development and vocational training for young people (18 - 26 yrs old) are life changing for them and their families.</narrative>
  </description>
